This package is a modified TypeScript port, not an upstream release.
Francesco Oddo and BeeGreat contributors translated Python code, split the
chain implementation into TypeScript modules, changed numeric handling to
bigint, integrated Viem and Effect, and added CLI, wallet, and application
integration behavior. Original BeeGreat contributions remain under the MIT
terms in LICENSE. Those terms do not replace upstream license conditions.

